<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-25T19:29:15.165Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:29:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces killed eight terrorists in operations in Peshawar and Bannu, while a former soldier was killed by armed men in Kabul. A building collapse in Karachi injured many and killed at least one person, and residents of Bajaur district died in a shipwreck off Libya. Afghanistan sentenced five nationals to prison for illegal border crossing and a Kabul shootout left six suspected robbers dead, while fresh fruit exports fell sharply after Pakistan closed its border. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBoLXJTak00WVJ1cFY4Vlljdk9fVDNZcDVEbnkydUxTUE5Lc3JDVm8tTm5rUm0zRUlDWTVBdDVpeVVUZlM4Y0lzZg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNclQ5eFRjNlZwSzN0ekJkZ2RmcDFzOHZ0SHdxYW95ZFpuQVJaUmk1WDRhTlFRdDdFVFI3TlFKVEtvYXVfTFN0ODFQZzAzTWwyS3ZDbVNDc1JWM2JmR012ZXptT0FfODU5Rmp3NzZUb21hZk1xSGU4b2huX3FWdmRMYkJsQjhieGY5VkV1Vw?oc=5&quot;&gt;8AM Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NDTV Sports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQU0xsc3FfbFN2d1pRdGFrdlBIVkpfXzRmLTAzRWdUanBVSE42RDE3TE5oVS1EdHpFMS13Q2FHMmowdEI3QVdoVVc1d29BS0Nvek54d0lBWms5eTFTX0hWQW9GZjVCWnczTVpLYi14SE1nRVRJcXFzSWVVWVZZRzZiVFFZQWgxWk9Da25KTXI3dTNlRUs0YUE3cllHNU9BZm_SAZ8BQVVfeXFMUFNMbHNxX2xTdndaUXRha3ZQSFZKX180Zi0wM0VnVGpwVUhONkQxN0xOaFUtRHR6RTEtd0NhRzJqMHRCN0FXaFVXNXdvQUtDb3pOeHdJQVprOXkxU19IVkFvRmY1Qlp3M01aS2IteEhNZ0VUSXFxc0llVVlWWUc2YlRRWUFoMVpPQ2tuSk1yN3UzZUVLNGFBN3JZRzVPQWZv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOZWpkVk9uNGNkdVlWSFpLdVV2bEpDbWNIdmFCb0VxZXROenJfRkc0d3dMU3FnbFNXbHNaQjAzaHJKWV94bjRncWxEUmVFdUVVU05qNlZ4OEZ2bkdjOWZLMnRWR1lWMHBKVmRzVnM